Portions are adapted from SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang): the stock
decode step of DeepSeek-V4.1 (the layer loop, the mHC boundaries, the attention, the
MoE, Engram and the head) follows SGLang's own model code (Apache License 2.0,
Copyright SGLang Team). Each adapted file names its origin in its header.

The stock verify step of GLM-5.3 (the layer loop, the residual steps, the attention,
the MoE and the logits) is adapted from SGLang's own model code in the same way
(Apache License 2.0, Copyright SGLang Team).

Portions are adapted from SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang): the stock
verify step of Qwen3.5 (the layer loop, the GatedDeltaNet, the attention and the MoE)
follows SGLang's own model code (Apache License 2.0, Copyright SGLang Team). Qwen3.5's
GatedDeltaNet verify slots follow SGLang's linear-attention backend; its causal conv
update (Apache License 2.0, Copyright contributors to the vLLM project, Copyright (c)
2024 Tri Dao); its gated RMSNorm Triton kernel, which SGLang adapted from
flash-linear-attention (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Tri Dao); and its ReplaySSM
verify kernel, which SGLang ported from the vLLM ReplaySSM reference implementation
(Apache License 2.0, Copyright contributors to the vLLM project). Each adapted file
names its origin in its header.

